WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.889
Every Christmas we say: next year.

2
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.540
This time I opened the laptop.

3
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.337
Somewhere with light.

4
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.192
We'd already agreed on a number. That was the easy part.

5
00:00:43.492 --> 00:00:46.004
It was everything else we didn't know.

6
00:00:50.492 --> 00:00:52.705
And whether we could do it from here.

7
00:01:01.892 --> 00:01:03.508
That one.

8
00:01:08.492 --> 00:01:09.767
Okay.

9
00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:21.739
PARTNER: You coming?

10
00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:23.675
In a minute.

